-Rabbi Ḥanina ben Dosa&lt;/i&gt;, before discussing possible links to other Syriac amulets and incantation bowls.</note></biblStruct><bibl type="formatted" subtype="bibliography" resp="https://www.zotero.org/styles/chicago-note-bibliography-17th-edition">
